 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Has He forgotten to be gracious?",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Has He shut off His mercy in anger?",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I said this is what wounds me deeply",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "That the right hand of the Most High has changed",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But I will remember the deeds of the Lord",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 3.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I will remember your wonders of old",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 4.12,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I will meditate on all your work",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 3.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And consider all your mighty deeds",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Your way, O God, is holy",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "What god is as great as God?",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You are the God who works wonders",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.06,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You made your strength known among the peoples",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With your arm you redeemed your people",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The descendants of Jacob and Joseph",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The waters saw you, O God",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 2.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
